• "from_address": fee payer – subtract ( "gas_price" * "receipt_gas_used" ) from balance  
• "to_address": counterparty  
• "value": Wei; an alternative to TRACES for simple transfers  
• "gas_price", "receipt_gas_used": compute transaction fees in Wei  
• "receipt_status": success/failure gate  
• "block_timestamp": activity dating / hour‑of‑day  

ETHEREUM_BLOCKCHAIN.ETHEREUM_BLOCKCHAIN.TOKEN_TRANSFERS  
